*>================================================================
*> PROGRAM:  lob_iceberg_engine.cbl
*> PURPOSE:  Iceberg Peak Execution & Hidden Reserve Replenishment
*> ================================================================
 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. LOB-ICEBERG-ENGINE.

 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01  WS-DELTA               PIC 9(08) COMP-5.

 LINKAGE SECTION.
 COPY "ICEBERG-CONFIG.cpy".
 01  LS-EXEC-QTY            PIC 9(08) COMP-5.
 01  LS-RELOADED-QTY        PIC 9(08) COMP-5.

 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING ICEBERG-ORDER-RECORD, LS-EXEC-QTY, LS-RELOADED-QTY.
 0000-MAIN.
     MOVE 0 TO LS-RELOADED-QTY
     IF LS-EXEC-QTY >= ICE-CURRENT-VISIBLE-QTY
         COMPUTE WS-DELTA = LS-EXEC-QTY - ICE-CURRENT-VISIBLE-QTY
         MOVE 0 TO ICE-CURRENT-VISIBLE-QTY
         IF ICE-HIDDEN-REMAIN-QTY > 0
             IF ICE-HIDDEN-REMAIN-QTY >= ICE-DISPLAY-PEAK-QTY
                 MOVE ICE-DISPLAY-PEAK-QTY TO ICE-CURRENT-VISIBLE-QTY
                 SUBTRACT ICE-DISPLAY-PEAK-QTY FROM ICE-HIDDEN-REMAIN-QTY
             ELSE
                 MOVE ICE-HIDDEN-REMAIN-QTY TO ICE-CURRENT-VISIBLE-QTY
                 MOVE 0 TO ICE-HIDDEN-REMAIN-QTY
             END-IF
             ADD 1 TO ICE-REPLENISH-COUNT
             MOVE ICE-CURRENT-VISIBLE-QTY TO LS-RELOADED-QTY
         ELSE
             MOVE 'F' TO ICE-STATUS-FLAG
         END-IF
     ELSE
         SUBTRACT LS-EXEC-QTY FROM ICE-CURRENT-VISIBLE-QTY
     END-IF
     GOBACK.
